XComments.
X.PP
XAnything enclosed in slashes is ignored.
X.DS
X\h'1i'/ The Longfodder Line of Alpo Fathead /
X[Alpo Fathead ^ & Gurkha Baksheesh /Wasn't she a half-orc?/ ]
X.DE
